      "normalized_math": "n=\\left(\\frac{8.960\\ \\mathrm{g\\ Cu}}{\\mathrm{cm}^3}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1\\ \\mathrm{mol}}{63.55\\ \\mathrm{g\\ Cu}}\\right)\\left(\\frac{6.02\\times10^{23}\\ \\mathrm{atoms}}{\\mathrm{mol}}\\right)\\left(\\frac{100\\ \\mathrm{cm}}{1\\ \\mathrm{m}}\\right)^3=8.5\\times10^{28}\\ \\mathrm{m}^{-3}",
